flowchart TD
    A[Authorized protected effect] --> P[Effect-bound approval if required]
    P --> O[Persist EffectObligation]
    O --> X[Attempt external effect]
    X --> R[Record ATTEMPTED]
    R --> C{Confirmation/reconciliation}
    C -->|Confirmed| Y[CONFIRMED]
    C -->|Failed| F[FAILED]
    C -->|Unknown| U[Remain uncertain / reconcile before retry]
